# Graph · nodes CRUD.
# Se ejecutan con la extensión REST Client de VS Code ("Send Request" sobre cada una) o con httpyac.
# Requires Neo4j: NEO4J_PASSWORD=... uv run prueba-chunking serve (standalone graph server: uv run prueba-chunking-data serve,
# then @graph = http://127.0.0.1:8001). Docs: http://127.0.0.1:8000/data/docs
# Run top to bottom: creates "test-*" nodes, tries the errors and deletes them (repeatable).

@graph = http://127.0.0.1:8000/data

# ── Nodes: create (201) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### nodes · create FACULTAD
POST {{graph}}/nodes/FACULTAD
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-eng", "properties": {"name": "Engineering"}}

### nodes · create PROGRAMA (properties of several types, including a list)
POST {{graph}}/nodes/PROGRAMA
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-cs", "properties": {"name": "Computer Science", "credits": 160, "active": true, "campuses": ["Manizales", "Pereira"]}}

### nodes · create ASIGNATURA
POST {{graph}}/nodes/ASIGNATURA
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-db", "properties": {"name": "Databases", "semester": 5}}

### nodes · create PIAA
POST {{graph}}/nodes/PIAA
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-671047", "properties": {"code": "671047", "year": 2024}}

### nodes · create JSON
POST {{graph}}/nodes/JSON
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-json", "properties": {"file": "2024-11-Semana_04-671047-piaa.json"}}

### nodes · create SECCION
POST {{graph}}/nodes/SECCION
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-section", "properties": {"title": "Assessment", "order": 3}}

### nodes · create FRAGMENTOS
POST {{graph}}/nodes/FRAGMENTOS
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-fragment", "properties": {"text": "The final exam is worth 60 %.", "tokens": 9}}

### nodes · create HALLAZGOS
POST {{graph}}/nodes/HALLAZGOS
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-finding", "properties": {"description": "A single exam carries more than 50 % of the grade"}}

### nodes · create ANTIPATRON
POST {{graph}}/nodes/ANTIPATRON
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-antipattern", "properties": {"name": "Concentrated assessment"}}

### nodes · create NORMA
POST {{graph}}/nodes/NORMA
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-rule", "properties": {"name": "Student regulations", "article": "Art. 40"}}

### nodes · create CHAT
POST {{graph}}/nodes/CHAT
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-chat", "properties": {"user": "teacher"}}

### nodes · create CONSULTA
POST {{graph}}/nodes/CONSULTA
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-query", "properties": {"question": "How is the course assessed?"}}

### nodes · create without id (one is generated; see the response). The cleanup doesn't delete it: delete it by hand
POST {{graph}}/nodes/CHAT
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# ── Nodes: read, list and update ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### nodes · read one
GET {{graph}}/nodes/PROGRAMA/test-cs

### nodes · list a label (ordered by id, 50 per page)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/CHAT

### nodes · list with pagination
GET {{graph}}/nodes/CHAT?page=1&per_page=1

### nodes · PATCH: changes credits and removes campuses (null), keeps the rest
PATCH {{graph}}/nodes/PROGRAMA/test-cs
Content-Type: application/json

{"properties": {"credits": 170, "campuses": null}}

### nodes · PUT: replaces all the properties (the ones not sent are removed)
PUT {{graph}}/nodes/FACULTAD/test-eng
Content-Type: application/json

{"properties": {"name": "Faculty of Engineering", "acronym": "FE"}}

# ── Nodes: errors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### nodes · repeated id (409)
POST {{graph}}/nodes/FACULTAD
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "test-eng"}

### nodes · doesn't exist (404)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/PROGRAMA/does-not-exist

### nodes · label outside the schema (422)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/PROFESOR

### nodes · property Neo4j can't store: a map (422)
POST {{graph}}/nodes/NORMA
Content-Type: application/json

{"properties": {"detail": {"a": 1}}}

# ── Cleanup: delete (204; repeating them gives 404) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### nodes · delete JSON: its relationships go with it (DETACH)
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/JSON/test-json

### nodes · check: PIAA no longer has the ES relationship
GET {{graph}}/nodes/PIAA/test-671047/relationships

### nodes · delete FACULTAD
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/FACULTAD/test-eng

### nodes · delete PROGRAMA
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/PROGRAMA/test-cs

### nodes · delete ASIGNATURA
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/ASIGNATURA/test-db

### nodes · delete PIAA
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/PIAA/test-671047

### nodes · delete SECCION
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/SECCION/test-section

### nodes · delete FRAGMENTOS
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/FRAGMENTOS/test-fragment

### nodes · delete HALLAZGOS
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/HALLAZGOS/test-finding

### nodes · delete ANTIPATRON
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/ANTIPATRON/test-antipattern

### nodes · delete NORMA
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/NORMA/test-rule

### nodes · delete CHAT
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/CHAT/test-chat

### nodes · delete CONSULTA
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/CONSULTA/test-query

### nodes · delete one that no longer exists (404)
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/CONSULTA/test-query
